 "app_Application_remaining": {
  "decision": "PARTIALLY MIGRATE",
  "rationale": "The approved Project 01 structure has no Application/ layer; Services/ is the application/use-case layer. Phase 0.18 had placed 2 Asset services under Application/Asset/Services, which contradicted the plan and was corrected in Phase 0.20 (Batch 2d). The remaining 32 classes are Financial/Payment/Pricing use cases (P3) and Booking use cases (P4) plus 17 Reporting read-side classes. None are P0/P1, and relocating financial/transactional orchestration in the same phase that restructured the tree would concentrate risk. They are DEFERRED with an explicit target, not left unclassified.",
